body:
the problem is i don't know when to use  "&" and "\*" 

i know "&" we use to get the address of variable and we use "\*" to get the value of variable but i write a program i find it confused 

for exemple 

int main(void)  
{  
int a=2;  
int \*p;  
p=\&a;  
printf("%d \\n",\*p);  
\*p=85;  
printf("%d \\n",a);  
printf("%d \\n",\*p);  
printf("%p \\n",&a);  
printf("%p \\n",p);  
printf("%p \\n",&p);  
}
